  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to draw on the energy of the multiverse to augment your attacks.</p><p>Once on your turn, when you hit a creature with a weapon attack, all damage dealt by the attack becomes force damage, and the creature takes an extra 1d8 force damage from the attack. When you reach 11th level in this class, the extra damage increases to 2d8.</p>",
